Welcome to MedPrimer Care
Expert clinical care delivered directly to the comfort and convenience of your home. Founded and led by Rosana Hollos, APRN, AGNP-C, our practice is dedicated to providing personalized, compassionate, and comprehensive mobile healthcare and care coordination services throughout Broward and the surrounding Palm Beach areas.

Meet Your Practitioner
Advanced Practice Provider & Clinical Care Coordinator

Rosana Hollos, APRN, AGNP-C


Holding her advanced practice credentials as a board-certified Adult-Gerontology Primary Care Nurse Practitioner, Rosana specializes in bridging healthcare gaps for older adults and individuals managing complex chronic conditions. By bringing clinical evaluations, medication management support, and proactive care coordination directly to your living room, we help reduce the stress of travel and ensure seamless communication between patients, families, and your broader medical team.

Our Core Services
Mobile Health Evaluations: Comprehensive in-home clinical assessments and routine check-ins.
Care Coordination: Navigating complex medical needs, specialist referrals, and post-discharge support.
Chronic Disease & Medication Oversight: Proactive management to help you stay healthy and independent at home.
